Z||000000||mutfish||02-09-2000||09:37 PM||||Had a warm sunny day today,what a great day to replace the clutch hydraulics that I flushed the atf from a while back....you all remember the atf thing right? Well to make a long story longer,I backed the hibernating GT from it's winter resting place,put the cylinders back,filled the system with DOT 5,bled that puppy,and "Presto Chango" a fully operational clutch!!!!Haven't driven it much, but so far it feels slicker than owl sh*t on a pump handle. Another lesson learned.....<p>[This message has been edited by mutfish (edited 02-09-2000).]||||reg||1
